\code{"YYYY-MM-DD"}. Default \link{FRED_REALTIME_MIN} (every vintage from the start).}

\item{\code{realtime_end}}{(scalar<character>) end of the vintage window, ISO
\code{"YYYY-MM-DD"}. Default \link{FRED_REALTIME_MAX} (through the latest vintage).}

